stigate pain he would come  face to face with all six pains and  ultimately be killed in battle but not  before being able to send an encoded  message back to the leaf to warn them  about his findings  naturally though naruto isn't the only  one to lose his idol here as sasuke  confronts itachi and hitachi passes away  due to his illness hiroshi han and  utakata are all ginchurikis of the four  five and six tails respectively and as  you might guess they were all killed  when their tailed beasts were removed  from them by the akatsuki during payne's  attack on the leaf village kakashi and  shizune were each killed kakashi while  protecting choji and his father and  shizune after payne reads her mind to  find naruto fakasaku the old frog who  partnered with naruto during his fight  with payne was also killed in that fight  as well however nagato eventually goes  to sacrifice his own life using the rene  rebirth to bring everyone back  soon after this sasuke comes face to  face with donzo the man who runs the  leaf on bu and who has stolen the eyes  of several uchiha making it pretty  fitting that sasuke would be the one to  take him out kisame who is hitachi's  partner also meets his fate when he is  defeated by might guy he's held captive  for a moment and rather than wanting to  be interrogated he summons sharks to  devour him whole konan the final member  of the trio jaraya raised in the hidden  reign and one of the final members of  the ikotsky along with setsu and obito  was killed by obito so that he could  retrieve nagato's renagon  fu and torune are ninja who were held  captive by obito obito wanted to have  kabuto demonstrate his summoning impure  world reincarnation technique however he  had no bodies to do so as such torune  was killed and foo was used as a  sacrifice and replaced by torune white  zetsu killed several medical ninja in  order to infiltrate ninja alliance bases  these included toyoso takamaru hino and  two others  wait zetsu himself would be killed by  sasuke after obtaining his eternal  mangekyo sharingan as a way to test his  new abilities and as we approach the  endgame we have the revival of the ten  tales this monster fired a bijudama  towards the shinobi alliance  headquarters killing shikaku nara who is  shikamaru's father inowichi yamanaka who  is eno's father and mabui the fourth  recage's assistant and like  the first two were sad but losing mabui  was a true tragedy those weren't the  only ones to lose their lives to the ten  tales though as it fired a piece of wood  at naruto and neji jumped in his way to  protect him ultimately leading to neji's  death which to me has always felt like a  death that just didn't need to happen  and believe it or not there are only  three relevant deaths left in the entire  series the first with obito one of the  big bads who attempted to redeem himself  by sacrificing his life to save naruto  and kakashi second being modera the  other main antagonist who died from  having all the tail beasts and the  ghetto statue removed from him when  kaguya was resurrected and finally  in that moment not only did modera die  but of course  the quality of writing in the series  died with him but that might just be me  but that is it all of the relevant  deaths in naruto and shippuden i  probably missed a few minor characters  here or there who were either pointless  or reanimations but i promise you if  they're not here they just probably  don't matter we covered over 150 people  so please cut me some slack for not  mentioning ninja number 4887  in the background of episode 368  that does raise the question though  which death in naruto was your favorite  or which do you think was the most  impactful for you or the story as a  whole let me know down in the comments  and if you enjoyed this video leave a  like as well doing those things will  help this video a lot with the youtube  algorithm of course if you aren't  subscribed to the channel be sure to hit  that notification bell to select all  notifications so you can see more  content as it comes out as i mentioned  before i also have a video on my own  channel talking about deaths in anime  which will be linked down below i think  you will really enjoy it if you take the  time to check it out and if you are  looking to follow the channel a little  bit closer you can always check out our  twitter and instagram at anime uproar or  you can follow myself at excellionyt  but for now thank you guys so much for  watching and until next time remember to  stay excellent  [Music]  [Music]  okay
 

